<view class="page" wx:if="{{module}}"><text class="crumb">复习 / {{module.name}}</text><text class="page-title topic-title">{{module.name}}分类复习</text><text class="page-subtitle">进入分类后，查看错得最多的具体题目，并可进行专项考试。</text><view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">选择分类</text><text class="section-note">按错题情况查看</text></view><view class="topic-list"><button wx:for="{{topics}}" wx:key="id" class="topic-card card" style="width: 100%; min-height: 210rpx;" hover-class="topic-hover" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onOpenTopic"><view><text class="topic-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="topic-meta">正确率 {{item.accuracy}}% · 已答 {{item.attempts}} 次</text><text class="topic-wrong">{{item.activeWrongCount}} 道待复习错题</text></view><text class="topic-arrow">›</text></button></view></view>
